:artwork_20260103_182856_835 rdf:type arto:Artwork ;
    dcterms:title "Artwork 20260103 182856 835"@en ;
    dcterms:description """A Chinese Ink Painting painting depicting a charcoal black and misty gray swallow in active flight, its medium-sized form captured mid-motion with wings gracefully extended. The swallow dominates the composition, positioned centrally in the midground as it soars through the gentle morning air. Its feathers are rendered with expressive ink washes that suggest both delicate texture and dynamic movement, creating a living form full of energy. The background features subtle, distant landscape elements—faint mountain silhouettes and wispy clouds—that recede into atmospheric perspective. The natural soft lighting of morning bathes the scene in a fresh, energetic yet subdued and gentle atmosphere, with ink gradations creating a sense of depth and tranquility. The spatial arrangement emphasizes the swallow's freedom of movement against the serene, expansive environment."""@en ;
    arto:style aat:300033936 ;
    dcterms:created "2026-01-03T18:29:20.315040"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterms:creator "AI Artwork Generation System" ;
    arto:medium arto:DigitalMedium .

